SOC=all (one kernel for SM8550 and SM8650, see build.sh)

rocknix/  ROCKNIX device patches rebased for the combined tree. A file here
          replaces ROCKNIX's patch of the same name. Each one is ROCKNIX's
          patch with only the context changed where the other SoC's patches
          touched the same lines:
  0063-gpu-drm-panel-add-pocket-fit-panel.patch (SM8650): Makefile hunk
          after the SM8550 AR06/AR02 panel lines.

patches/  port patches for the combined tree only, queued with the port
          patches by name:
  0506-mailbox-qcom-ipcc-every-soc-counts-its-doorbell-wakes.patch: on top
          of SM8550 0504/0505, gives SM8650 the "ipcc-wake" count (SM8650's
          0019 is written against the unmasked driver).

port-skip SM8650 port patches the combined tree leaves out (each replaced by
          an SM8550 twin or a patch in patches/). Port patches whose code is
          identical to the other SoC's (e.g. SM8650 0021 = SM8550 0539) are
          dropped automatically.
